  "name": "Pyromancer: Phoenix periodic healing skips totems and Witch Doctor wards (#13479)",
  "contract": [
    "#13479: Phoenix Egg 800796 spawns creature 50258, whose UpdateAI casts periodic heal 707110 on every unit",
    "returned by AscensionPyromancer::Allies(). Spell.dbc gives 707110 TARGET_UNIT_SRC_AREA_PARTY, whose native",
    "target check (WorldObjectSpellTargetCheck) rejects IsTotem(); live Ascension combat logs confirm 0 heals on",
    "SUMMON_TYPE_TOTEM wards, idols, effigies, and totems while players and Phoenix 50258 are healed. Previously,",
    "AscensionPyromancer::Allies() checked only IsInRaidWith() and IsFriendlyTo(), without excluding IsTotem()",
    "or CREATURE_TYPE_TOTEM (11), so both native Shaman totems (IsTotem() == true) and Witch Doctor wards/idols",
    "(plain TempSummons with creature_template.type == CREATURE_TYPE_TOTEM) received 707110 heals. In a 3-player",
    "party (Pyromancer, Witch Doctor, Shaman) with Serpent Ward (50105), Spirit Idol (50106), and Stoneskin Totem",
    "(5873) active beside the Phoenix, one tick of 707110 heals the 3 party players and Phoenix 50258 (total",
    "spell_heal_count == 4, spell_cast_count == 4) rather than 7, while all three totems/wards remain present."
  ],
